#: ../../source/docs/checklist.rst:5 2688b8cf822249189a9f7f1f9cb9e8f0
msgid "Pre-Flight Checklist (Copter)"
msgstr "起飞前检查清单（Copter）"

#: ../../source/docs/checklist.rst:7 267e6f65b9114e99bc152d2a80418074
msgid ""
"This page is provides a list of things to check following configuration, and"
" before your first flight."
msgstr "本页列出了完成配置后、首飞之前需要逐项检查的内容。"

#: ../../source/docs/checklist.rst:11 fcc85f5749644ba2b5a70d3259eee758
msgid "Summary Checklist"
msgstr "检查清单一览"

#: ../../source/docs/checklist.rst:17 5cb1b959447344d2b02560e575062313
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "参数配置"

#: ../../source/docs/checklist.rst:19 032bed082fae4133a6a92c0abffc9655
msgid ""
"Spin up the propellers on the ground and check they are all moving :ref:`in "
"the correct orientation <connect-escs-and-motors_attach_propellers>`."
msgstr ""
"在地面让螺旋桨先转一下，检查所有螺旋桨 :ref:`旋转方向是否正确 <connect-escs-and-"
"motors_attach_propellers>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/checklist.rst:21 42f3dd609b564647b7ad3c4d3293e23f
msgid ""
"Check that your copter knows what level is. With the copter on a flat "
"surface connect to Mission Planner and ensure the artificial horizon display"
" shows level."
msgstr "确认机器已经知道什么是水平。将机器放在水平地面上，连接 Mission Planner，并检查人工地平仪显示为水平。"

#: ../../source/docs/checklist.rst:24 1628bd8ec6fa455da7952270226a45d4
msgid ""
"Check all failsafe settings are enabled. Instructions are here for "
":ref:`radio <radio-failsafe>`, :ref:`battery <failsafe-battery>`, and "
":ref:`ekf/gps <ekf-inav-failsafe>`."
msgstr ""
"确认所有失控保护设置均已启用。各项设置说明：:ref:`遥控 <radio-failsafe>`、:ref:`电池 <failsafe-"
"battery>`、:ref:`EKF/GPS <ekf-inav-failsafe>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/checklist.rst:29 10e87f8e39464f72a0d038dfc3bd4816
msgid "Flying"
msgstr "飞行"

#: ../../source/docs/checklist.rst:31 4ffcd8adb12c49caa695f300138058f9
msgid ""
"Make sure you have a GPS lock before flying if you intend to use any auto "
"modes. Even if you're only flying in Stabilized mode this is a good idea so "
"you can invoke Return To Launch if you get into trouble."
msgstr ""
"如果你计划使用任何自动模式，起飞前请确认已经 GPS 定位锁定。即便你只使用 Stabilize "
"模式飞行，这样做也是个好习惯——一旦出现意外，可以随时触发 Return To Launch 安全返航。"

#: ../../source/docs/checklist.rst:34 2c451ff04d984747ac38932fb736ad84
msgid ""
"Test RTL before sending your copter off on an auto waypoint flight. This is "
"to check that the compass and GPS are working, and that it knows where home "
"is before heading off on a more complex flight."
msgstr "在让机器执行自动航点飞行前，先测试 RTL。这样可以在进入更复杂飞行前验证罗盘与 GPS 正常工作、机器已知 Home 点位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/checklist.rst:37 7dd562d46dc443ff8b000f32501447df
msgid ""
"Ensure that flight in Stabilize works well before you attempt any more "
"complex flight modes. Ensure loiter works before trying RTL. Ensure RTL "
"works before trying auto."
msgstr ""
"在尝试更复杂的飞行模式前，先确认 Stabilize 模式飞行良好。先确认 Loiter 正常再尝试 RTL；先确认 RTL 正常再尝试 Auto。"

#: ../../source/docs/checklist.rst:40 03ffea1efea14be7bcfbfaf805c03dba
msgid ""
"Once armed stand 3m-6m away from the arming point as when in RTL the copter "
"will be returning to this point."
msgstr "解锁后请站在距解锁点 3—6 米的位置——因为 RTL 时机器会返回该解锁点。"

#: ../../source/docs/checklist.rst:42 c38a273d0b7143c1817d7c77077c8042
msgid ""
"When testing more complex flight modes, be ready to switch back to Stabilize"
" mode at any moment if it does anything strange. Stabilize or Acro are the "
"only modes which can save you from a problem with the software or sensors. "
"RTL is a good mode to save you from human error, but relies on the copter "
"being able to locate and fly itself, so this should not be used as an "
"emergency mode if other auto flight modes go wrong."
msgstr ""
"测试更复杂的飞行模式时，请随时准备好——一旦出现异常立即切回 Stabilize 模式。Stabilize 与 Acro "
"是唯一能在软件或传感器出问题时救你的模式。RTL "
"适合用来挽救操作失误，但它依赖机器自身的定位与飞行能力，因此当其他自动模式出问题时，不应将其作为应急模式使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/checklist.rst:49 cad79241689648928f6e1608008d367a
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Be sure you have a way of knowing when your battery is getting low, and land"
" before you have used more than 80% of your battery capacity."
msgstr "请确保你能知晓电池电量何时偏低，并在电池容量使用超过 80% 之前完成降落。"
